<title>USA: TABLE - Lands' End Inc Q2 net, sales rise.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Lands' End Inc Q2 net, sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>DODGEVILLE, Wis. 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			$  0.11		   $ 0.09</p>
<p> Net			  3,428		    2,950</p>
<p> Revs		     219,883		  196,160</p>
